<!-- Teaching layer over exact approved source fb8354e. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">A refresh is already in flight when the user signs out. Its successful response arrives later. Saving that response into a generic current-token slot can bring the old session back.</p>

<!-- @before 4. OkHttp Authenticator (Silent Refresh) :: animation -->
### The response still belongs to the retired session

<section class="pb-figure" data-pb-flow="scene" aria-label="A refresh reply arrives after logout">
<h3>Walkthrough 1. A refresh reply arrives after logout</h3><p class="pb-sub">Illustrative local ownership race. One vault belongs to one login; encryption and server revocation are separate controls.</p>
